<title>USA: Morgan Group Inc qtly divs on class A and B.</title>
<headline>Morgan Group Inc qtly divs on class A and B.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Group Inc declared a quarterly dividend of $0.02 per share of class A common stock.</p>
<p>		    Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		   $0.02</p>
<p> Pay		    Oct 14</p>
<p> Record		Sept 30</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>Morgan Group Inc declared a quarterly dividend of $0.01 per share of class B common stock.</p>
<p>		    Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.01		   $0.01</p>
<p> Pay		    Oct 14</p>
<p> Record		Sept 30</p>
